Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.html
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
  Header always set Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
  Header always set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'none'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'"
</IfModule>
